OL,3,CProgramme listings for
OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 1 MAR
OL,4,G0600FAfrodeutsche
OL,5,     GReclaim your Sunday morning with
OL,6,     GAfrodeutsche. From ambient
OL,7,     Gtextures to soulful grooves, it's
OL,8,     Gthe restorative musical flow you
OL,9,     Gneed to reset your mind and find
OL,10,     Gyour center.
OL,11,G0800FRadcliffe and Maconie
OL,12,     GAhead of World Book Day, Mark and
OL,13,     GStuart present a feast of book-
OL,14,     Gthemed music and chat including
OL,15,     Gtracks from Broadcast, Bo Diddley
OL,16,     Gand Kate Bush.
OL,17,G1000FCerys Matthews
OL,18,     GSt David's Day poetry and Welsh
OL,19,     Ginspiration with Matthew Francis,
OL,20,     Gplus fresh jazz perspectives and
OL,21,     Gcreative insights from Southbank
OL,22,     GCentre producer Deborah Bankole.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Radio CTravel FNat Sport
FL,207,200,150,300,000,100
