OL,4,G1300FGuy Garvey's Finest Hour
OL,5,     GGuy chats to Thomas White of
OL,6,     GWhite Magic for Lovers and the
OL,7,     GElectric Soft Parade.
OL,8,G1600FIggy Pop
OL,9,     GIggy serves up a sonic cocktail
OL,10,     Gto soundtrack your Sunday
OL,11,     Gafternoon. This week, he's got
OL,12,     GTyler, The Creator, Jenny Hval,
OL,13,     GJoe Tex, Fiona Apple and Brian
OL,14,     GEno in his record bag.
OL,15,G1800FMary Anne Hobbs
OL,16,     GWith a borderless spectrum of
OL,17,     Gmusic, new experiments in
OL,18,     GStorytelling and sound.
